*$ *********************************************************************
* Model of PWM TL5001
* Added on  12 Nov 2002 by sjaiswal
* Pin Names :
* 1-->OUT		5-->SCP
* 2-->VCC		6-->dtc
* 3-->COMP		7-->RT
* 4-->FB		8-->GND
*
.SUBCKT TL5001 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8 PARAMS:VMIN=0.7 VMAX=1.3 PERIOD=0.1m
.PARAM MIN={VMIN}
.PARAM MAX={VMAX}
.PARAM PER={PERIOD}
.PARAM RT={0.49995*{PER}}
.PARAM FT={0.49994*{PER}}
.PARAM PW={0.00001*{PER}}
.ic v(5)=180m
*Oscillator Section
VV441 91 0 PULSE {MIN} {MAX} 0 {RT} {FT} {PW} {PER}
*DTC PIN
VN 91 7 0V
F991 8 6 VN 1
*ERROR AMPLIFIER
Radderr 3 0 100k 
VV111   12 28 80u
VV113   15 8 2.1
DD113   16 3  M3MMID 
G111   8 13 12 4 1
VV112   14 8 1.72
II111   4 8 DC 160n  
DD111   14 13 M3MMID 
CC111   13 8  106.10329539459689e-9  
RR112   8 13  10k  
II113  3 16  DC 600u  
